params.prompt:
@Image1 — the person: keep her face, skin tone, hairstyle and outfit exactly as in the photo.
@Image2 — the bag: use this exact Diesel bag (shape, size, material, color, logo, hardware, straps). Do not redesign it or change the logo.
@Video1 — camera only: copy only the camera path, framing, timing and speed of the camera moves. Take nothing else from this video (no character, no body motion, no style, no lighting).

Scene: a seamless white photo studio with a soft white cyclorama, even diffused light and soft contact shadows under her feet. Clean high-end fashion editorial look.

Subject: a young woman with a sleek black bob and a heavy blunt fringe. She wears oversized amber-brown tinted sunglasses, a small silver earring, an oversized fuzzy black mohair crew-neck sweater, and a crisp white shirt underneath. The shirt's pointed collar sits over the neckline and its long white cuffs stick out below the sleeves. She also wears high-waisted black pleated wide-leg trousers that fall to the floor and pointed snakeskin-print shoes.

Action: she walks toward the camera with a natural, calm, elegant runway gait. Her steps are even and her feet plant firmly on the floor. Her body moves smoothly and fluidly, with no twitching. Her right hand carries the Diesel bag from @Image2 by its handles, and it swings gently with realistic weight. Her left hand stays in her trouser pocket the whole time, with the white cuff visible.

Camera: a bolt-cam robotic arm move that follows the camera path of @Video1. It tracks her walk, glides fast into an extreme close-up of her eye behind the amber lens with a shallow depth of field, pulls back out, then makes a sweeping orbit to her right while she keeps walking. Every move is perfectly smooth, like a motion-control rig: dynamic speed with eased acceleration and deceleration. There is zero camera shake, zero jitter, no handheld feel and no wobble.

Style: photorealistic, 1080p, 60fps, silky smooth motion, natural skin texture, true fabric detail, accurate snakeskin pattern, accurate Diesel branding exactly as in @Image2.

Negative: camera shake, jitter, stutter, frame skipping, flicker, the body motion or character from @Video1, beige tote, any other bag, changed logo, extra hands, the hand coming out of the pocket, face morphing, warped legs, sliding feet, text

